{"unit_id":"caisiyang123__dsh-tick-rail#card-zh","repo":"caisiyang123/dsh-tick-rail","commit":"2d103df93a7c4c11e43807cee525321b39730033","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tick-rail 是面向 DeepSeek Harness Web 客户端的会话导航插件。它通过客户端模块在 shell.overlay 界面层加入一列消息刻度，每格对应用户提问或补充指令，跳过助手回复。鼠标悬停时，当前刻度突出并显示消息片段；点击刻度可平滑跳转到对应消息，也可用方向键选择并按回车或空格跳转。它还会在消息较少时隐藏导航，并随窗口和对话变化重新测量。适合需要快速定位长对话中自己提问的 DSH 用户；无需额外 API key 或外部服务配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1-7","client.js:91-107","client.js:368-390","cordis.patch.yml:4-6"]}
{"unit_id":"caisiyang123__dsh-tick-rail#card-en","repo":"caisiyang123/dsh-tick-rail","commit":"2d103df93a7c4c11e43807cee525321b39730033","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-tick-rail adds a tick rail to the DeepSeek Harness web client, with one mark for each user prompt or steering note. Hover to preview a message, then click its tick or use the keyboard to jump to it. The rail hides in short conversations and needs no API key or external service.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1-7","client.js:91-107","client.js:368-390","cordis.patch.yml:4-6"]}
